The `@source` paths here are incorrect relative to `packages/runner/src/index.css`. For example, `../../packages/components/...` resolves to `packages/packages/components/...` (extra `packages/`) and `./src/**/*` resolves to `src/src/**/*`. This will break Tailwind class scanning for the runner and workspace packages. Adjust the paths to correctly point to `packages/components`, `packages/react`, etc. from `packages/runner/src`.
```suggestion
@source './**/*.{ts,tsx}';
@source '../../components/src/**/*.{ts,tsx}';
@source '../../react/src/**/*.{ts,tsx}';
@source '../../plugin-kanban/src/**/*.{ts,tsx}';
@source '../../plugin-charts/src/**/*.{ts,tsx}';
```

`@source './src/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx}'` is relative to `examples/object-view-demo/src/index.css`, so it resolves to `examples/object-view-demo/src/src/**` and won't match any files. The other `../../packages/...` sources also resolve under `examples/` rather than the repo root. This will prevent Tailwind from scanning the demo and workspace code, resulting in missing styles.
```suggestion
@source './**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx}';
@source '../../../packages/designer/src/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx}';
@source '../../../packages/components/src/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx}';
```

`@source './src/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx}'` is relative to `examples/designer-modes/src/index.css`, so it resolves to `examples/designer-modes/src/src/**` and won't match any files. The other `../../packages/...` sources also resolve under `examples/` rather than the repo root. This will prevent Tailwind from scanning the example/workspace code and can cause missing styles.
```suggestion
@source './**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx}';
@source '../../../packages/designer/src/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx}';
@source '../../../packages/components/src/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx}';
```

`@source './src/**/*.{ts,tsx}'` is relative to this CSS file (packages/components/src/index.css), so it resolves to `packages/components/src/src/**` which doesn't exist. This will prevent Tailwind from scanning component files and can lead to missing styles. Update the `@source` to target the actual TS/TSX files under the current directory (e.g., `./**/*.{ts,tsx}`).
```suggestion
@source './**/*.{ts,tsx}';
```
